{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB新劇《驅魔速遞》上星期舉行了開鏡拜神儀式，正式投入拍攝的工作，其實一直以來都有不少網民在街上偶遇劇組拍攝，然後分享到網上。昨日（18日）就有網民偶遇劇中主角周嘉洛及陳曉華在街上「拍拖」，網民寫下：「出門撞到seventeen mingyu同meovv anna拍拖。」</p><figure><img alt=\"周嘉洛同陳曉華被網民話冇CP感。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166554485368033280469702.jpeg/7fFapd-EykveQJjoM1vF9IgTe57A9XK5Hy1_wx8tf8M\"/><figcaption>周嘉洛同陳曉華被網民話冇CP感。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>周嘉洛及陳曉華似韓星？</p><p>其實就有網民笑稱周嘉洛及陳曉華很像韓團seventeen的金珉奎及meovv的日藉成員田中杏奈，不過其他網民就不認同，認為發文者應該要去「驗眼」，更搞笑地表示：「明明就係金成安！」</p><figure><img alt=\"認為發文者應該要去「驗眼」。(thread截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166556145167765504971065.png/JmvHzap0V-5_FXjf0psRtadvJmnmBjFVksOyLJLDsiw\"/><figcaption>認為發文者應該要去「驗眼」。(thread截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"其他網民就不認同。(thread截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166556142806241280109437.png/6TFVAK6dyoR39Q5VWsjwWFnmgkogmDsMya_6yMmv-sg\"/><figcaption>其他網民就不認同。(thread截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周嘉洛似eventeen的金珉奎。(IG圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166556140599906304961230.jpeg/qJloxTfoDpj95o0Lu8_kpBT7B_ccM4vKfjald342pXc\"/><figcaption>周嘉洛似eventeen的金珉奎。(IG圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳曉華似meovv的日藉成員田中杏奈。(IG圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166556138179661824130975.jpeg/eYVsBwLNL2MRzHgHKjziY8VDsNLhdJeaJt2nPCbdpzw\"/><figcaption>陳曉華似meovv的日藉成員田中杏奈。(IG圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T03:20:41.339975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}